ass=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>C. <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><msup><mn>5</mn><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{3&#x27;\\!-\\!AATT\\!-\\!5&#x27;}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8352em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">3</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">AATT</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">5</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>D. <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>5</mn><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><msup><mn>3</mn><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{5&#x27;\\!-\\!TTAA\\!-\\!3&#x27;}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8352em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">5</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">TTAA</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">3</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>限制酶化学本质：从原核生物中提取的<strong>识别并切割特定碱基序列</strong>（4-8 个碱基、常用回文序列）的双链 DNA <strong>内切酶</strong>；切割方式：错位切（黏性末端）或平齐切（平末端）；</li>\n<li>常用酶记住：<strong>EcoRⅠ</strong>（GAATTC → AATT 突出）、<strong>BamHⅠ</strong>（GGATCC）；其余（HindⅢ 等）考卷会给识别序列，按&quot;画双链标切点&quot;方法现场切即可；</li>\n<li>答题原则：①审清给的是&quot;链方向&quot;还是只给单链；②画图、标方向、数位点、找突出端；③<strong>相同限制酶切目的基因与载体</strong>保证黏性末端互补；④限制酶也可用于<strong>基因序列分析/指纹</strong>（检测特定序列——&quot;基因敲除&quot;体内酶不参与，仅体外工具）；</li>\n<li>易错：把&quot;3'-AATT-5'&quot;与&quot;5'-AATT-3'&quot;搞混（书写方向必须 5'→3'）；把酶的&quot;识别&quot;位置与&quot;切割&quot;位置当同一位置（识别序列通常连着切割位点，但可能错位几个碱基）；</li>\n<li>真题关联：限制酶与载体构建为新高考生物选填高频考点。🔗 真题公开资料：<a href=\"https://gaokao.neea.edu.cn/\">中国教育考试网·普通高考</a>（官方试题评析）。</li>\n</ul>\n","standardHtml":"<p><strong>写全双链并标切口：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>5' G ↓ A A T T C 3'    （G 与 A 之间切断）\n3' C T T A A ↑ G 5'    （下链在 A 与 G 之间切断，切口与上链错开 4 个碱基）\n</code></pre>\n<ul>\n<li>上链：切点把上链分成 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>5</mn><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><msup><mn>3</mn><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{5&#x27;\\!-\\!G\\!-\\!3&#x27;}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8352em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">5</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">3</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 碎片（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span> 碱基）与 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>5</mn><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><msup><mn>3</mn><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{5&#x27;\\!-\\!AATTC\\!-\\!3&#x27;}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8352em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">5</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">AATTC</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">3</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 片段；</li>\n<li>下链：切成 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><msup><mn>3</mn><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{CTTAA3&#x27;}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">CTTAA</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">3</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span> 碱基）与 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>5</mn><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{5&#x27;G-}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8352em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">5</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">G</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span> 碱基）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>未配对的单链部分为 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>5</mn><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><msup><mn>3</mn><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{5&#x27;\\!-\\!AATT\\!-\\!3&#x27;}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8352em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">5</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">AATT</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">3</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（上链 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>5</mn><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 端突出的 4 个碱基）——这就是 <strong>黏性末端</strong>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>黏性末端的方向性：一定是 <strong>5' 端</strong>或 <strong>3' 端</strong>的突出端；同一种酶切出的两个黏性末端序列<strong>相同</strong>（如均为 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>5</mn><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><msup><mn>3</mn><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{5&#x27;\\!-\\!AATT\\!-\\!3&#x27;}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8352em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">5</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">AATT</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">3</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），碱基序列互相配对，可直接连接；</li>\n</ul>\n<p>选 <strong>A</strong>。</p>\n","evilHtml":"<p><strong>&quot;切点错开 → 突出 4 个碱基；切点对齐 → 平末端&quot;</strong>：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>先数一下：上链切口与下链切口之间差几个碱基，谁长谁突出；突出端就是&quot;没配对的那一段&quot;（AATT 是 4 个碱基）。\n<strong>口诀</strong>：<strong>&quot;G 后 A 前切开，AATT 伸出 4 个&quot;</strong>（EcoRI 直接记住）。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><strong>为什么</strong>：黏性末端就是&quot;一条链比另一条链长出来的一截&quot;，只能靠互补配对才能连：两个相同黏性末端互补（AATT 与 AATT 反向互补，正好配对形成 8 碱基？不——两条粘端互补拼接，实际是 G...AATT 与 AATT...G 互补），所以<strong>同一种酶切的末端可连</strong>，不同酶乱切则可能不能连。</p>\n<p>30 秒出 A。</p>\n","meta":{"status":"draft","keywords":[],"summary":"E c o R I \\mathrm{EcoR\\,I} EcoR I 限制酶识别双链 DNA 上的序列 G A A T T C 3 ′ \\underset{3&#x27;}{\\text{G A A T T C}} 3 ′ G A A T T ","source":"自编（经典考法：基因工程工具酶为新课标生物常考）","difficulty":"中等","applicability":"选填通用","risk":"限制酶识别序列的切割位点在**两条链上错开**时才产生黏性末端（错位切割）；黏性末端的书写要比对互补链方向（5'→3'）；不同限制酶的黏性末端可以相同（同尾酶），相同黏性末端才能连接。目的基因与载体都要用**相同限制酶**切割（或产生可互补的黏性末端）。","fit":["限制酶的识别序列与切割位点","黏性末端的产生与互补配对","基因工程载体构建","选填题"],"updated":"Tue Mar 04 2025 08:00:00 GMT+0800 (中国标准时间)"},"breadcrumbs":[{"slug":"biology","title":"生物"},{"slug":"biotech","title":"生物技术与工程"},{"slug":"bioengineering","title":"生物技术与工程"},{"slug":"restriction-enzyme","title":"基因工程·限制酶识别与黏性末端"}],"children":[],"siblings":[{"slug":"biotech","title":"生物技术与工程","type":"knowledge"},{"slug":"fermentation-embryo-problems","title":"发酵工程与胚胎工程选填速练","type":"example"},{"slug":"gene-engineering-problem","title":"基因工程大题·引物设计与答题框架","type":"knowledge"},{"slug":"hybridoma","title":"单克隆抗体制备流程（四步走）","type":"example"},{"slug":"pcr-technology","title":"PCR 技术·原理与过程辨析","type":"example"}]}